# Class-table features are rules text unless an explicit PCGen numeric grant is present.
Sentinel Reserve Points (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_SENTINEL_RESERVE_POINTS|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_SENTINEL_RESERVE_POINTS|max(1,floor(SPHERES_SENTINEL_LEVEL/2)+WIS)	DESC:%SPHERES_SENTINEL_RESERVE_POINTS daily reserve points; spending and recovery are table-resolved; apply to qualifying rolls or uses only.
Sentinel Reserve Temporary HP (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_SENTINEL_RESERVE_TEMPORARY_HP|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_SENTINEL_RESERVE_TEMPORARY_HP|2*BAB+WIS	DESC:%SPHERES_SENTINEL_RESERVE_TEMPORARY_HP temporary hit points per reserve point; lasts one minute or until lost, not a permanent HP increase; apply to qualifying rolls or uses only.
Sentinel Class Features 1	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DESC:Level 1: Combat training, defender’s soul, guardian challenge, sentinel’s reserve, wise reflexes. See https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/sentinel for effects, timing and prerequisites.
