Sentinel Combat Training	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresInternal.SpheresCombatTraining	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Spheres Martial Focus	DEFINE:SPHERES_PRACTITIONER_DC|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_PRACTITIONER_MOD|WIS	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_PRACTITIONER_DC|10+floor(SPHERES_SENTINEL_LEVEL/2)+SPHERES_PRACTITIONER_MOD
Sentinel Second Wind	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature.Extraordinary	DEFINE:SPHERES_SENTINEL_SECOND_WIND_DICE|floor(SPHERES_SENTINEL_LEVEL/2)	DEFINE:SPHERES_SENTINEL_SECOND_WIND_BONUS|WIS	DESC:Spend a reserve point as a swift action to heal d6 per two Sentinel levels plus Wisdom modifier, up to half maximum HP. Halve healing to regain martial focus, declared before rolling. Spending, healing, and the level-7 extra-point exception are table-resolved.
Sentinel Wise Reflexes	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature.Extraordinary	BONUS:COMBAT|INITIATIVE|max(0,min(WIS,SPHERES_SENTINEL_LEVEL)-DEX)|TYPE=Ability	BONUS:SAVE|Reflex|max(0,min(WIS,SPHERES_SENTINEL_LEVEL)-DEX)|TYPE=Ability	DESC:Use capped Wisdom instead of Dexterity when it improves initiative or Reflex saves.
Sentinel Dedicated Defense	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature.Extraordinary	DR:0/-	BONUS:DR|-|1+floor((SPHERES_SENTINEL_LEVEL-2)/4)	DESC:Damage reduction stacks with other DR/- sources. Challenge-specific doubling remains table-resolved.
Sentinel Defender's Soul	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Guardian Sphere	DESC:Free Guardian challenge package; if already possessed, choose a legal Guardian talent instead.
